# Implementation notes (recorded 2026-10-27; statuses above remain the task driver):
# - Control channel: runner.hello role=host must present the per-boot host token; only its
#   SHA-256 travels in boot.json, the token lives in a host-only file outside the run mount.
# - Exit codes (wb and workbox): 0 ok, 1 internal, 2 usage, 3 not found, 4 denied/unavailable,
#   5 timeout; wb run propagates the wrapped command's exit code.
# - Deviation, task 2.5: PTY uses util-linux script(1) instead of node-pty to keep the runner
#   dependency-free; resize sets TIOCSWINSZ on the slave with coreutils stty -F and the kernel
#   delivers SIGWINCH.
# - Deviation, task 3.1: the server is built on node:http, not Fastify, keeping the same route,
#   auth, schema-400 and audit contract without a framework dependency.
# - Seccomp (task 2.2): ptrace is denied outright (non-descendant scoping is not expressible in
#   plain seccomp); the program is x86_64 only in v1.
# - Spec-gap defaults adopted: create rejects unknown fields; idempotency key + different
#   profile is a conflict; lease expiry never auto-kills; ask answers are validated per kind;
#   REST error envelope is {error:{code,message,details?,requestId}}.
